      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING HILDA (1) box seated early before forging to the lead turning and lifting to score (22.85) at this track in a Grade 5 over 400m. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. REBORN DESTINY (2) was out of in the placings when fourth last time but prior to that posted a swift 22.86 win over 400m at this track. Top win two back and rates a key player again. ZIPPING OSAKA (7) goes very well this course and distance starting 15 times for five wins and seven minors. Placed last time (22.94) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 0.8 lengths. Can feature in the finish. FLYING STRATUS (8) was strongly fancied last time on the back of a win two back but could only manage third (23.07) at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide.",
